bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    wm_retained_damage_rejects_parent_sampling_window_material_2026-11-26, 0, "On the hosted local WM lane (local target CPU) a fluid_light window chrome batch samples its parent backdrop (_engine2d_draw_ir_batch_samples_parent true), and _engine2d_draw_ir_render_composition_damaged_with_images rejects any such batch as retained-composition-unsafe-embedding. So every fluid_light (the production default theme) scene with a window repaints the whole frame on a clock tick or window move; the retained damage replay only reaches the default chrome. A clipped replay cannot simply re-run the material: outside the clip the framebuffer holds the window's own composited output, not the backdrop the material must sample, so a fix needs the padded backdrop region re-rendered first."

bugs_active |id, severity, status, title, file, line, reproducible_by, created_at, updated_at, valid|
    wm_retained_damage_rejects_parent_sampling_window_material_2026-11-26, P2, fix-implemented-verification-pending, "retained damage replay rejects every backdrop-sampling (fluid_light) window", doc/08_tracking/bug/wm_retained_damage_rejects_parent_sampling_window_material_2026-11-26.md, 1, test/02_integration/rendering/engine2d_wm_local_lane_clock_tick_spec.spl, 2026-11-26, 2026-11-27, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    wm_retained_damage_rejects_parent_sampling_window_material_2026-11-26, 0, "2026-11-26 wm-lane-20261126 Linux aarch64 seed fb80903917d6d5f5: 160x120 scene, focused 120x80 window with a pixel-surface content frame, CPU target composition: batches wm-desktop/wm-chrome/surf-content/wm-taskbar-objects samples_parent=false, surf samples_parent=true under fluid_light; Engine2dWmFrameExecutor.render on a clock tick logs retained-damage-fallback reason=retained-composition-unsafe-embedding and presents path=software."
    wm_retained_damage_rejects_parent_sampling_window_material_2026-11-26, 1, "2026-11-27 fix implemented in engine2d_wm_frame_executor.spl (_wm_replay_parent_sampling_composition: padded offscreen scratch backdrop + intersecting parent-sampling batch replay + unpadded damage commit, last_present_path=software-retained-damage). Verified CPU parity --mode=interpreter: wm_retained_parent_sampling_damage_spec 4/4, engine2d_retained_group_opacity_damage_spec 2/2, wm_retained_clock_tick_spec 8/8, wm_retained_damage_behavior_spec 8/8. engine2d_wm_local_lane_clock_tick_spec updated to expect software-retained-damage and passed 3/3 via _vulkan_unavailable on Windows host (vkEnumeratePhysicalDevices count=0 / VK_ERROR_INITIALIZATION_FAILED -3). waiting-for: Linux/Vulkan hardware verification (NVIDIA GB10 / llvmpipe, SIMPLE_2D_REQUIRE_VULKAN=1) of engine2d_wm_local_lane_clock_tick_spec."
